            "title": "Ingredients & Materials",
            "content": "<p>All SayLa lip balms are crafted with a certified organic base made from beeswax, coconut oil, sunflower seed oil, and natural essential oils. Free from synthetic flavors, parabens, and phthalates.</p>",
