        "accordion_zKnzrk": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to Use + App Integration",
            "content": "<p>Apply balm as needed to soothe and hydrate lips. Each balm is printed with a soul-centered affirmation prompt—like “Worthy”—to encourage truth-speaking.</p><p>Scan the QR code on the tube to access the SayLa app, where you'll find full affirmations and personalized encouragement.</p>",
