        "accordion_QVdpqK": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Questions, Answered",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>What makes this lip balm different?</strong></li></ul><p>SayLa turns a simple swipe of balm into a small soul-care ritual. Each tube pairs a clean, organic formula with a truth-based affirmation to help you pause, breathe, and come back to what’s steady and grounding.<br/></p><ul><li><strong>Is the formula organic and clean?</strong></li></ul><p>Yes. Our balm is made with USDA-certified organic ingredients and contains no parabens, petroleum, synthetic fragrances, or fillers. It’s conscious lip care you can feel good about using every day.</p><p></p><ul><li><strong>How does the balm connect with the SayLa App?</strong></li></ul><p>Every tube includes a QR code that unlocks your full affirmation and personalized encouragement inside the SayLa App. The app learns what you need most—peace, confidence, resilience—and sends gentle prompts that pair with your daily lip balm ritual.</p><p></p><ul><li><strong>Is this safe for sensitive lips?</strong></li></ul><p>Our formula is gentle and dermatologist-friendly. If you have known sensitivities to natural oils, beeswax, or essential oils, we recommend reviewing the ingredient list and doing a small patch test before regular use.<br/></p><ul><li><strong>How long does one tube typically last?</strong></li></ul><p>With normal daily use, most customers find that one tube lasts about 6–8 weeks. Your timing will depend on how often you apply it throughout the day.<br/></p><ul><li><strong>Is this a good gift?</strong></li></ul><p>Yes. Each balm arrives thoughtfully designed and beautifully packaged, making it a meaningful gift for women who love intentional, purpose-driven self-care.<br/></p><ul><li><strong>Is SayLa faith-based or for everyone?</strong></li></ul><p>SayLa is inspired by timeless truth found in scripture, but it’s created to be welcoming and accessible to anyone. Our affirmations are written to be grounding and encouraging regardless of faith.</p>",
            "uppercase_title": true,
            "icon": "none",
            "custom_icon": "shopify://shop_images/SayLaLogomark-Black.png",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
